<!--
  Phase 6: every user-visible string in the app lives here.

  Two rules this file has to respect, both checked in CI
  (phase6/scripts/check-ui-strings.sh):
    * no copy is hardcoded in a composable - `Text("...")` in the UI layer fails
      the build;
    * a referenced R.string.* that is not defined here fails the build.

  Copy rules of its own, from the Phase 6 brief:
    * no API jargon in prose (no endpoint names, no ports, no "SSE");
    * nothing implies a terminal, a URL, Termux, SSH or a remote server;
    * degraded states are named by what the user can do about them, and the raw
      upstream text is always available next to the headline;
    * no other product's branding or wording.
  Apostrophes are avoided rather than escaped so the file stays readable in diff.
-->
